{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Army</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f0fcf4d5599a51b8e5fd977afd87f585.poster.avif?t=1752904303\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f0fcf4d5599a51b8e5fd977afd87f585.webm?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f0fcf4d5599a51b8e5fd977afd87f585.mp4?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin battle with few production buildings and grow into an unstoppable force. Production buildings are continuously creating new units, forming the composition of your army. What you decide to build will determine strengths and weaknesses of your army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f8ef8532d6856e0354feacc65cfb31b3.poster.avif?t=1752904303\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f8ef8532d6856e0354feacc65cfb31b3.webm?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f8ef8532d6856e0354feacc65cfb31b3.mp4?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every unit has its own unique look and ability. Majority of abilities are useful most of the time and some abilities are more specialized that give you more ways to outplay your opponent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Engaging Multiplayer Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/9ea742dd5a80bdd8406793006404abeb.poster.avif?t=1752904303\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/9ea742dd5a80bdd8406793006404abeb.webm?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/9ea742dd5a80bdd8406793006404abeb.mp4?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host or join intense multiplayer matches. You can join any public lobby or create your own. You can host a private lobby with your friends and play in tournaments against each other or play together in CO-OP mode. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876480?t=1752904303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876480?t=1752904303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/ef92013ebceaad2bc2a4ed59e3d9462d2e2ee09f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752904303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/ef92013ebceaad2bc2a4ed59e3d9462d2e2ee09f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752904303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Fantasy battle simulator. All kinds of creatures kill each other. Every creature have its death animation and sound."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Army</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f0fcf4d5599a51b8e5fd977afd87f585.poster.avif?t=1752904303\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f0fcf4d5599a51b8e5fd977afd87f585.webm?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f0fcf4d5599a51b8e5fd977afd87f585.mp4?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin battle with few production buildings and grow into an unstoppable force. Production buildings are continuously creating new units, forming the composition of your army. What you decide to build will determine strengths and weaknesses of your army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f8ef8532d6856e0354feacc65cfb31b3.poster.avif?t=1752904303\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f8ef8532d6856e0354feacc65cfb31b3.webm?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/f8ef8532d6856e0354feacc65cfb31b3.mp4?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every unit has its own unique look and ability. Majority of abilities are useful most of the time and some abilities are more specialized that give you more ways to outplay your opponent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Engaging Multiplayer Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/9ea742dd5a80bdd8406793006404abeb.poster.avif?t=1752904303\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/9ea742dd5a80bdd8406793006404abeb.webm?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/extras/9ea742dd5a80bdd8406793006404abeb.mp4?t=1752904303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host or join intense multiplayer matches. You can join any public lobby or create your own. You can host a private lobby with your friends and play in tournaments against each other or play together in CO-OP mode. </p>","developers":["Mythforge Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3636000","name":"Fortress Frenzy"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876480/d2d5eef4f3f3292d84cf96d5e07bdb8ae24c2010/header.jpg?t=1752904303","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257169226,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169226/movie480.mp4?t=1752603727","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169226/movie_max.mp4?t=1752603727"},"name":"Fortress Frenzy | Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257169226/d9a3745335d5834bbc88333e9766226406772964/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752603727","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra